---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | CheckMOTPro.co.uk"
  description="Terms of Use for CheckMOTPro.co.uk. Information on vehicle data sources, warranties, and permitted use."
>
  <div class="legal-container">
    <div class="legal-card">
      <span class="badge">Legal</span>
      <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: October 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using CheckMOTPro.co.uk ("the Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the Service.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Nature of the Service</h2>
      <p>
        CheckMOTPro.co.uk provides a free vehicle information search tool aggregating public data from the UK Driver and Vehicle Standards Agency (DVSA) and Driver and Vehicle Licensing Agency (DVLA). This data includes MOT test records, recorded odometer histories, advisory and failure notices, and road tax due dates.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Disclaimer of Warranties & Liability</h2>
      <p>
        While we strive for 100% accuracy, all vehicle records are provided "as is" and "as available". The information reflects recorded data submitted by MOT test centres and government agencies. CheckMOTPro.co.uk makes no warranty that records are completely error-free, uninterrupted, or up to the minute.
      </p>
      <p>
        Users are strongly advised to perform a physical vehicle inspection and independent pre-purchase inspection before committing to buy any used motor vehicle. CheckMOTPro.co.uk shall not be liable for any mechanical defects, misrepresentations by vehicle sellers, or financial losses arising from reliance on the data.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Intellectual Property & OGL v3.0</h2>
      <p>
        Vehicle data is published under Crown Copyright and the UK Open Government Licence v3.0. Site design, code, proprietary analysis models, and branding are the property of CheckMOTPro.co.uk.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Permitted & Prohibited Uses</h2>
      <p>
        The Service is intended for consumer, personal, and legitimate automotive checking purposes. Automated scraping, bulk denial of service requests, or unauthorized reverse engineering of the backend API is strictly prohibited.
      </p>

      <div class="back-home">
        <a href="/" class="btn-primary">← Return to MOT Check</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 5rem;
  }
  .legal-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 2.5rem;
  }
  .badge {
    background: rgba(255, 209, 0, 0.15);
    color: var(--primary);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0.25rem;
  }
  .updated {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0.5rem;
    color: #fff;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .back-home {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }
  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #0b0f19;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
